all-transcripts/2026/11/03/equitable-eqh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,0,1,1.19],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[1,1,0,1.19,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0181,"r5":0.0212,"r1_spy":0.0151,"r5_spy":0.0204}}],"quotes":[{"c":"EQH 2018 Q2","e":"eqh","d":"2018-08-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anders Malmstrom","x":"Look, I think after all the restructuring has been done, now the biggest change in corporate and other was really the debt.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"EQH 2018 Q2","e":"eqh","d":"2018-08-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Erik Bass","x":"It's a little bit surprised to see the drop in net investment income quarter over quarter because I think that was a business that you had highlighted as one of the bigger beneficiaries from the general account restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q2-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"EQH 2020 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anders Malmstrom","x":"Finally AB's adjusted operating margin expanded by 220 basis points so 29.7% driven by lower operating expenses resulting from focused cost reduction initiatives, including the Nashville relocation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EQH 2020 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Suneet Kamath","x":"And I think for your comments, a lot of that was due to cost savings from the Nashville move.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EQH 2020 Q4","e":"eqh","d":"2021-02-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anders Malmstrom","x":"While we expect some volatility to continue, we maintain our guidance of $30 million to $60 million earnings impact for the 100,000 excess U.S. death claims.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EQH 2021 Q2","e":"eqh","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robin Raju","x":"Looking ahead, we have begun internal restructuring, targeting an increase of unregulated cash flow from 35% up to approximately 50% by year-end, which will decrease our reliance on dividends from our New York subsidiary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"EQH 2021 Q2","e":"eqh","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robin Raju","x":"To date, about half of the internal restructuring is complete with an increase in unregulated cash flows of approximately $100 million per annum through internal finances.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"EQH 2021 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Pearson","x":"We have also completed our previously announced internal restructuring and now expect 50% of annual cash flows from noninsurance regulated subsidiaries of our holdings company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q3-2019-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"EQH 2021 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robin Matthew Raju","x":"Our strong tradition has further enabled us to quickly and effectively execute our balance sheet initiatives such as restructuring and reserve financing, which I will review on the following page.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q3-2019-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"EQH 2021 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tom Gallagher","x":"The -- just to confirm, the the life raising guidance, the $75 million, if COVID mortality remains elevated, would you expect that to be lower than that over the near term?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/axa-equitable-holdings-inc-eqh-q3-2019-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"EQH 2026 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Wilma Burdis","x":"And then if you could give us a little bit more color on your data center and AI investments, which I realize you call out are very small, but little bit more color would help.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/equitable-eqh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EQH 2026 Q3","e":"eqh","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robin Matthew Raju","x":"We also raised our guidance for the full year performance fees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/equitable-eqh-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,6029,0,0,0,4900,828],[35,1,5292,0,0,0,4112,793],[36,1,7288,0,0,0,5977,925],[37,1,7683,0,0,0,5949,1295],[38,1,6913,0,0,0,5436,1200],[39,1,8433,0,0,0,6664,1383],[40,1,6301,0,0,0,4803,1183],[41,1,7960,0,0,0,6556,1140],[42,1,6495,0,0,0,5241,999],[43,1,6632,0,0,0,4977,1362],[44,1,8154,0,0,0,6542,1230],[45,1,6291,0,0,0,4647,1354],[46,1,6869,0,0,0,3308,3019],[47,1,5940,0,0,0,4734,912],[61,1,8059,0,0,0,6716,1057],[62,1,7706,0,0,0,6105,1247],[63,1,8477,0,0,0,6787,1380],[64,1,8086,0,0,0,6657,1202],[65,1,8575,0,0,0,6423,1560],[66,1,7251,0,0,0,5689,1258],[67,1,8608,0,0,0,6233,1652]],"cinema":[[34,1,6029,0,0,0,4900,828],[35,1,5292,0,0,0,4112,793],[36,1,7288,0,0,0,5977,925],[37,1,7683,0,0,0,5949,1295],[38,1,6913,0,0,0,5436,1200],[39,1,8433,0,0,0,6664,1383],[40,1,6301,0,0,0,4803,1183],[41,1,7960,0,0,0,6556,1140],[42,1,6495,0,0,0,5241,999],[43,1,6632,0,0,0,4977,136